{"title":"Kids are protesting against I.C.E. in Roblox","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/kids-are-protesting-ice-raids-in-roblox-brookhaven","date":1750093900000,"content":"<div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W_e0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d1734-5195-4c72-b4b2-31cc7010b02c_800x419.gif\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W_e0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d1734-5195-4c72-b4b2-31cc7010b02c_800x419.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"419\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W_e0!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d1734-5195-4c72-b4b2-31cc7010b02c_800x419.gif 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W_e0!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d1734-5195-4c72-b4b2-31cc7010b02c_800x419.gif 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W_e0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d1734-5195-4c72-b4b2-31cc7010b02c_800x419.gif 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W_e0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_lossy/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d1734-5195-4c72-b4b2-31cc7010b02c_800x419.gif 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Recently, Roblox players have been conducting virtual I.C.E. immigration raids. Roblox players dressed as I.C.E. agents have barged into other player’s houses. They have \"arrested\" a user hiding in his kitchen and chased down another player while conducting “border patrol” surveillance. Roblox I.C.E. agents <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@riobandzblox/video/7514558091401219358\">hunted down a young player</a> in his bedroom before banging his door down. </p><p>Tensions reached a boiling point and last week, as <a href=\"https://www.foxla.com/news/los-angeles-ice-protests-day-10\">thousands took to the streets to protest I.C.E. in the offline world</a>, Roblox players protested within the game, battling cops, breaking down barricades, waving Mexican flags, and facing off across a line of players dressed in police SWAT gear. </p><p>Despite being primarily a children’s game, Roblox has evolved into a sort of emergent civic theatre for kids online. The game is now where thousands of children go to process major world news events through highly intricate role play. These simulations are how many young people experience news events, representing a shift towards more participatory forms of media. </p><p>Simon Gutierrez, a 17 year old high school student, who organized yesterday's Roblox protest against I.C.E. said that he wanted to attend the IRL No Kings protests this past weekend, but his older sister said no. So, he staged a protest on Roblox to allow other young people to make their voices heard. “A lot of young people really want to protest and put their words and beliefs out there but are unable to, so this is the only thing we can turn to,” Gutierrez said. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5hPq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38722772-9fa3-4af8-a436-3b0b4be22fec_3000x1000.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5hPq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38722772-9fa3-4af8-a436-3b0b4be22fec_3000x1000.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5hPq!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38722772-9fa3-4af8-a436-3b0b4be22fec_3000x1000.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5hPq!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38722772-9fa3-4af8-a436-3b0b4be22fec_3000x1000.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5hPq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38722772-9fa3-4af8-a436-3b0b4be22fec_3000x1000.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5hPq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38722772-9fa3-4af8-a436-3b0b4be22fec_3000x1000.png 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The I.C.E. protests in Roblox have primarily taken place in Brookhaven, a massively multiplayer role‑playing experience on Roblox. The experience's name is based on t<a href=\"https://www.wsbtv.com/news/local/dekalb-county/1-arrested-protestors-fill-buford-highway-over-response-immigration-raids-los-angeles/T5R4JDB44VHY7N2KCDU3XKFINU/\">he real city of Brookhaven, GA</a>, where offline I.C.E. raids and protests are also taking place. Last Thursday, police <a href=\"https://www.wjcl.com/article/brookhaven-georgia-ice-protest-arrests/65044874\">arrested six people</a> involved in anti-I.C.E. protests in IRL Brookhaven. GA. </p><p>Brookhaven is the <a href=\"https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Brookhaven_by_Voldex/Brookhaven_RP\">most‑visited Roblox experience ever</a> with over 65–70 billion visits, and it has essentially become the internet’s default metaverse where events in the “real” world often play out in game. </p><p>Since the initial I.C.E. protest in Brookhaven last week, half a dozen more protests have been planned. Roblox users are posting dates and times on TikTok along with their usernames or Discord server links, in order to coordinate and solicit attendance for the rallies. The response from TikTok users has been enthusiastic. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CAAY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F92b3c5d7-c655-45fb-a4e2-c3313a7d08a1_3000x1000.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CAAY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F92b3c5d7-c655-45fb-a4e2-c3313a7d08a1_3000x1000.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CAAY!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F92b3c5d7-c655-45fb-a4e2-c3313a7d08a1_3000x1000.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CAAY!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F92b3c5d7-c655-45fb-a4e2-c3313a7d08a1_3000x1000.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CAAY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F92b3c5d7-c655-45fb-a4e2-c3313a7d08a1_3000x1000.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CAAY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F92b3c5d7-c655-45fb-a4e2-c3313a7d08a1_3000x1000.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This is not the first time Roblox has gotten political. In 2020, teenage Roblox users replicated the wave of protests against racial injustice and police brutality following George Floyd’s murder. Roblox users have also protested Israel’s assault on Gaza, staging pro-Palestine virtual protests in the fall of 2023. One pro-Palestine protest was visited more than 275,000 times. The protests against I.C.E have not yet reached that scale. </p><p>In-game activism also isn’t an entirely new phenomenon. Even before Roblox, children mobilized in other game-centric communities. In 2016 Club Penguin users protested Donald Trump’s election. Some kids used their avatars to express political dissent at a time when they weren’t even old enough to vote. Players in Animal Crossing and Roblox also staged protest events pushing Hong Kong’s pro-democratic movement in 2020.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Mic!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36010691-6631-448e-ba99-86b3ab60ec90_3000x1000.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Mic!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36010691-6631-448e-ba99-86b3ab60ec90_3000x1000.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Mic!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36010691-6631-448e-ba99-86b3ab60ec90_3000x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Mic!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36010691-6631-448e-ba99-86b3ab60ec90_3000x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Mic!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36010691-6631-448e-ba99-86b3ab60ec90_3000x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5Mic!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36010691-6631-448e-ba99-86b3ab60ec90_3000x1000.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Roblox boasts about 85 million daily active users globally. In December 2022, more than four in ten Roblox gamers were 12 years old or younger and 60% of users were under the age of 16. But there are signs that the platform’s demographic might be slowly shifting. </p><p>While 32 million players, about 40% of Roblox’s daily users, are still under the age of 12, 21% are between the ages of 17 to 24, and 18% are over the age of 25. The user base is aging up, and with older teens and young adults now making up a larger share, there has been demand for more mature content and experiences. </p><p>Role playing real-world events allows young people to experiment with their identity and political agency in a low-stakes environment. A <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.18705\">recent study</a> by Cornell University tracking kids aged 8 to 13, found that in-game roleplay and avatar customization helped kids explore their identities. Roblox, according to some kids I talked to, feels like a test-drive for the adult world. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nwdj!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fea26ef54-b8f9-4c1a-8ae8-4601a25ef9dd_3000x1000.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nwdj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fea26ef54-b8f9-4c1a-8ae8-4601a25ef9dd_3000x1000.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nwdj!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fea26ef54-b8f9-4c1a-8ae8-4601a25ef9dd_3000x1000.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nwdj!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fea26ef54-b8f9-4c1a-8ae8-4601a25ef9dd_3000x1000.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nwdj!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fea26ef54-b8f9-4c1a-8ae8-4601a25ef9dd_3000x1000.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nwdj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fea26ef54-b8f9-4c1a-8ae8-4601a25ef9dd_3000x1000.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Because of social media, kids today are simply more aware of the news than they were in previous generations. Young people see these major events taking place in the offline world and they want to participate. Roblox gives them a space to do that, whether it’s protesting or expressing your emergent political identity as a Trump-supporting I.C.E. agent. </p><p>“A lot of participants are exploring and trying to see what they politically identify as,” Gutierrez said. Gutierrez noted that the players role playing as I.C.E. agents within the game are also children. </p><p>There’s also the social aspect of it. Not only does participating in these events offer community, usually orchestrated through Discord servers, but there’s social clout to participating and posting about a viral event. Posts on TikTok about the I.C.E. protests have amassed thousands of views on TikTok and YouTube. </p><p>As Roblox continues to grow in popularity and relevance, I’m definitely watching the evolution of Brookhaven specifically. Brookhaven won two Roblox Innovation Awards in 2024. One for “Best Roleplay/Life Sim” and one for “Best Social Hangout”. It was also nominated for Favorite Video Game at the Kids’ Choice Awards in 2022 and 2023. There are entire TikTok accounts solely dedicated to the happenings in Brookhaven and even emergent news channels like <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@brookhaven.newsoffical?_t=ZT-8xFGko9qjkc&amp;_r=1\">Brookhaven News Official</a> that act as local news channels for the game. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6itt!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F014af1b3-2ecb-47b0-8a18-ae77d77082d1_3000x1000.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6itt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F014af1b3-2ecb-47b0-8a18-ae77d77082d1_3000x1000.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6itt!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F014af1b3-2ecb-47b0-8a18-ae77d77082d1_3000x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6itt!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F014af1b3-2ecb-47b0-8a18-ae77d77082d1_3000x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6itt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F014af1b3-2ecb-47b0-8a18-ae77d77082d1_3000x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6itt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F014af1b3-2ecb-47b0-8a18-ae77d77082d1_3000x1000.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I predict that digital protests will also have greater offline political impact as the digital realm increasingly becomes default reality. And it will be interesting to see what effect digital political expression in games like Roblox has on young people as they develop their nascent political ideologies. </p><p>These Roblox protests are now many young people’s first form of political engagement, and I wonder how much these online, in-game experiences are shaping their views of the offline world.</p><p>Rather than freak out that kids, including some under the age of 12, are participating in political events online, Dr. Kei Nishiyama, lecturer at Kaichi International University said that we should foster young people’s digital political engagement. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fvOW!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F746881c3-6b56-47d2-868f-f1941fdbfcbc_3000x1000.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fvOW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F746881c3-6b56-47d2-868f-f1941fdbfcbc_3000x1000.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fvOW!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F746881c3-6b56-47d2-868f-f1941fdbfcbc_3000x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fvOW!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F746881c3-6b56-47d2-868f-f1941fdbfcbc_3000x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fvOW!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F746881c3-6b56-47d2-868f-f1941fdbfcbc_3000x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fvOW!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F746881c3-6b56-47d2-868f-f1941fdbfcbc_3000x1000.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>“No matter how we adults – or those who have political power – try to depoliticize children’s online experience, children can politicize it in an unpredictable fashion,” Nishiyama told <em><a href=\"https://www.dazeddigital.com/life-culture/article/61323/1/here-s-why-young-people-are-protesting-in-virtual-worlds-roblox-palestine\">Dazed</a></em> in 2023. “Rather than depoliticize children’s experience, we have to acknowledge that children can be political – in other words, they are not future citizens, but citizens of today.”</p><p>“We’re children of the internet,” one young Roblox player <a href=\"https://www.dazeddigital.com/life-culture/article/61323/1/here-s-why-young-people-are-protesting-in-virtual-worlds-roblox-palestine\">said</a>, “it’s what we use to navigate and understand the world.”</p><p>Gutierrez said that, \"instead of doubting the Roblox protesters, people should try to understand where they're coming from.” After Gutierrez’s first protest against I.C.E. went well and he posted about it on TikTok, he’s been flooded with requests to stage another one. He’s planning another one, likely for next week. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8a1E!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2bfd15b-cbf0-4eac-8055-47280cd3b13c_3000x1000.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8a1E!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2bfd15b-cbf0-4eac-8055-47280cd3b13c_3000x1000.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8a1E!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2bfd15b-cbf0-4eac-8055-47280cd3b13c_3000x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8a1E!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2bfd15b-cbf0-4eac-8055-47280cd3b13c_3000x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8a1E!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2bfd15b-cbf0-4eac-8055-47280cd3b13c_3000x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8a1E!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2bfd15b-cbf0-4eac-8055-47280cd3b13c_3000x1000.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/kids-are-protesting-ice-raids-in-roblox-brookhaven?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY1ODkyMTYwLCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.sXenF2M1Y4z8tOL0Xg44ndHdBTppkD4BP6Prk57R5Zs\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>What I’m reading</h2><p><strong>Crimes of the Century </strong></p><p>How Israel, with the help of the U.S., broke not only Gaza but the foundations of humanitarian law. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/V0Vx2#selection-1203.0-1207.99\">NY Mag</a></em></p><p><strong>‘A Billion Streams and No Fans’: Inside a $10 Million AI Music Fraud Case</strong> </p><p>A chart-topping jazz album! Loads of Spotify and Apple Music plays! Just one problem: The success might not be real. - <em><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/ai-bots-streaming-music/\">WIRED</a></em></p><p><strong>What You’ve Suspected Is True: Billionaires Are Not Like Us</strong> </p><p>They have fantasies of going to Mars, transhumanism, and superhuman AI. How the heck does someone get this way? And what does it mean for the rest of us? - <em><a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/culture/culture-commentary/billionaires-psychology-tech-politics-1235358129/\">Rolling Stone</a></em></p><p><strong>Tanks, guns and face-painting</strong></p><p>The uncanny festivities of the US Army’s 250th anniversary, celebrated on Donald Trump’s birthday.. - <em><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/politics/687301/trump-military-parade-army-birthday-washington-dc\">The Verge</a></em></p><p><strong>The Man Who Unsolved a Murder</strong> </p><p>If you’re accused of a crime, will someone investigate your side of the story? In California, there’s no guarantee. - <em><a href=\"https://calmatters.org/investigation/2025/06/public-defense-investigators/\">Cal Matters</a></em></p><p><strong>Long COVID is Now the Number One Chronic Illness in Children</strong> </p><p>Since 2019, school attendance has taken a massive hit and never recovered to pre-pandemic levels, for obvious reasons; kids are sicker. - <em><a href=\"https://www.thegauntlet.news/p/long-covid-is-now-the-number-one\">The Gauntlet</a></em></p><p><strong>I’m Running Out of Ways to Explain How Bad This Is (Again)</strong> </p><p>Despite there being more documentary evidence than ever before in history: Information is abundant, yet consensus is elusive. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/jgqon#selection-669.130-669.255\">The Atlantic</a></em></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/kids-are-protesting-ice-raids-in-roblox-brookhaven?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY1ODkyMTYwLCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.sXenF2M1Y4z8tOL0Xg44ndHdBTppkD4BP6Prk57R5Zs\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>User Mag news rundown </h2><ul><li><p>As many as 6 million people joined the <a href=\"https://www.thedailybeast.com/data-guru-g-elliott-morris-says-up-to-6-million-people-attended-no-kings-anti-donald-trump-protests\">No Kings protests</a> this past weekend, making it the biggest demonstration in U.S. history. Between 1 and 2 percent of the total population <a href=\"https://www.thedailybeast.com/data-guru-g-elliott-morris-says-up-to-6-million-people-attended-no-kings-anti-donald-trump-protests/\">of the U.S. participated</a>. </p></li><li><p>The American Girl Doll fandom and the Barbie fandom r<a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/tolcser.bsky.social/post/3lrmcx4mo7s2k\">ecreated the No Kings protests</a> with dolls on Instagram. </p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hnkF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe00b3045-d0f9-495d-baab-0ece60a1ed49_1046x1278.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hnkF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe00b3045-d0f9-495d-baab-0ece60a1ed49_1046x1278.png\" width=\"541\" height=\"660.9923518164436\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hnkF!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe00b3045-d0f9-495d-baab-0ece60a1ed49_1046x1278.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hnkF!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe00b3045-d0f9-495d-baab-0ece60a1ed49_1046x1278.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hnkF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe00b3045-d0f9-495d-baab-0ece60a1ed49_1046x1278.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hnkF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe00b3045-d0f9-495d-baab-0ece60a1ed49_1046x1278.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>The hashtag is #dollstakeastand </figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><p>No, Taylor and Travis were not at the No Kings protest. An AI slop photo spread on Threads and Facebook appearing to show the couple in blue shirts. It’s fake!</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oQFN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44b55fc4-d283-470d-ac59-8dcab3c195cb_1234x1200.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oQFN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44b55fc4-d283-470d-ac59-8dcab3c195cb_1234x1200.png\" width=\"475\" height=\"461.91247974068074\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oQFN!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44b55fc4-d283-470d-ac59-8dcab3c195cb_1234x1200.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oQFN!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44b55fc4-d283-470d-ac59-8dcab3c195cb_1234x1200.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oQFN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44b55fc4-d283-470d-ac59-8dcab3c195cb_1234x1200.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oQFN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44b55fc4-d283-470d-ac59-8dcab3c195cb_1234x1200.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>Cops are warning Korn fans that their smart watches are <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/cops-warn-korn-fans-smart-watches-mistake-mosh-pits-for-collisions-make-emergency-calls-3214888/\">mistaking mosh pits for collisions</a> and making emergency calls.</p></li><li><p>Gen Z wants in-office sex to be a totally acceptable thing. 38% of Gen Zers want private spaces at work <a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91350604/gen-z-wants-office-hook-up-spaces\">to hook up because work–life balance</a>.</p></li><li><p>Bill Nye says he keeps begging RFK Jr. to <a href=\"https://futurism.com/bill-nye-rfk-texts\">stop texting him</a>.</p></li><li><p>MAGA factions are <a href=\"https://www.mediaite.com/opinion/maga-factions-breaking-apart-over-israel-strike-trump-is-cheerleading\">splintering over Trump’s support</a> for Israel’s strike on Iran.</p></li><li><p>People spend most of their time on YouTube watching <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2025-06-16/concert-ticket-prices-are-falling-for-the-first-time-in-years\">videos that are longer than 20 minutes</a>.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D3oc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9c641a99-620e-4858-a67c-8300cc5523c8_1270x648.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D3oc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9c641a99-620e-4858-a67c-8300cc5523c8_1270x648.png\" width=\"434\" height=\"221.44251968503937\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D3oc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9c641a99-620e-4858-a67c-8300cc5523c8_1270x648.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D3oc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9c641a99-620e-4858-a67c-8300cc5523c8_1270x648.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D3oc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9c641a99-620e-4858-a67c-8300cc5523c8_1270x648.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D3oc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9c641a99-620e-4858-a67c-8300cc5523c8_1270x648.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a><figcaption>And they say social media is killing our attention spans!</figcaption></figure></div></li><li><p>More job applicants are <a href=\"https://futurism.com/companies-bragging-ai-job-applicants\">using AI during</a> their job interviews. </p></li><li><p>MrBeast guest starred as himself in <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/youtube/mrbeast-guest-stars-as-himself-mariah-careys-type-dangerous-music-video-3214996/\">Mariah Carey’s new music video</a> (in his <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/tiktok/mrbeasts-hood-video-becomes-his-most-liked-tiktok-ever-3199238/\">“hood” look</a>)</p></li><li><p>New dad trend is <a href=\"https://www.gq.com/story/kid-tattoos\">getting tattoos of their kids drawings</a>. </p></li><li><p>Scientists spent four years studying remote work and found that <a href=\"https://www.cmu.fr/en/scientists-have-studied-remote-work-for-4-years-and-have-reached-a-clear-conclusion-working-from-home-makes-us-happier-9712/\">working from home makes people happier</a>.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Soft clubbing is taking over nightlife as <a href=\"https://www.thecut.com/article/what-is-soft-clubbing.html?utm_campaign=thecut&amp;utm_medium=s1&amp;utm_source=twitter\">young people</a> choose dancing and mocktails over hangovers.</p></li><li><p>Concert ticket prices are down 6% this year -- <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2025-06-16/concert-ticket-prices-are-falling-for-the-first-time-in-years\">the steepest drop since 2012</a>.</p></li><li><p>Silicon Valley wants to ban Chinese drones <a href=\"https://sfstandard.com/2025/06/14/drone-san-francisco-spfd-trump-xi/\">while ‘covering’ San Francisco</a> in their own.</p></li><li><p>Google experiments with AI-generated podcast hosts <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/google-search-ai-overviews-podcast\">in search results</a>.</p></li><li><p>RIP the <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/dyson-discontinues-air-purifying-headphones\">dangerous, public health disaster</a> Dyson air-purifying headphones that no one asked for, and that spread dangerous airborne disease to others around you. </p></li><li><p>Elon Musk says he wants to <a href=\"https://x.com/esjesjesj/status/1934118688719815112\">reprogram Grok AI</a> after it kept telling him he was wrong.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IGby!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5a44f8c3-69ef-4690-a390-ae3beb32d534_1179x472.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IGby!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5a44f8c3-69ef-4690-a390-ae3beb32d534_1179x472.jpeg\" width=\"445\" height=\"178.1509754028838\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IGby!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5a44f8c3-69ef-4690-a390-ae3beb32d534_1179x472.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IGby!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5a44f8c3-69ef-4690-a390-ae3beb32d534_1179x472.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IGby!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5a44f8c3-69ef-4690-a390-ae3beb32d534_1179x472.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IGby!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5a44f8c3-69ef-4690-a390-ae3beb32d534_1179x472.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>Climate change is <a href=\"https://futurism.com/climate-change-cheese-cows\">ruining cheese</a>, scientists and farmers Warn.</p></li><li><p>A woman was arrested after stealing over $400,000 to <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/woman-arrested-after-stealing-over-400000-to-spend-on-tiktok-3214922/\">buy gifts for streamers</a> on TikTok.</p></li><li><p>Does dressing like Ebenezer Scrooge help you sleep better? One man set to find out. (<a href=\"https://www.gq.com/story/ebenezer-scrooge-pajamas-help-sleep\">It doesn’t</a>)</p></li><li><p>From fist fights, to pepper spray, to black markets, <a href=\"https://sfstandard.com/2025/06/11/labubu-toy-craze-san-francisco-pop-mart/\">Labubus are sparking chaos</a>.</p></li><li><p>Japanese game developer reveals most of their employees <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/gaming/japanese-game-developer-reveals-most-of-their-employees-use-generative-ai-3214970/\">use generative AI.</a></p></li><li><p>MrBeast says he spent over<a href=\"https://x.com/MrBeast/status/1933895084115689760\"> $4 million</a> on his next YouTube video after 171 days of filming and 11,000 hours of footage.</p></li><li><p>A new <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/medical-tech/brain-implant-bci-als-talk-sing/\">brain-computer interface</a> is helping ALS patients sing and speak again by decoding their brain signals into language.</p></li><li><p>The lines between meme and persona have collapsed as we enter the age of <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DKumIlMMdXv/?igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\">synthetic fame</a>.</p></li><li><p>Alex Soros and Huma Abedin’s <a href=\"https://archive.ph/fctZ9#selection-511.133-511.171\">Hamptons wedding</a> drew the Clintons, Kamala, Anna Wintour and more. </p></li><li><p>The U.S. Navy is <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/06/15/the-u-s-navy-is-more-aggressively-telling-startups-we-want-you/\">aggressively courting </a>tech startups.</p></li><li><p>Two British men were arrested <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/two-british-men-arrested-after-stealing-6-million-golden-toilet-3214986/\">after stealing $6 million golden toilet</a>.</p></li><li><p>A YouTuber is travelling 8,500 miles to <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/youtube/a-youtuber-is-travelling-8500-miles-to-try-every-buc-ees-in-2-weeks-3215077/\">try every Buc-ee’s in 2 weeks</a>.</p></li><li><p>The Washington Post is in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/media/2025/jun/14/washington-post-in-talks-with-substack-about-using-its-writers\">talks with Substack</a> about using its writers on the platform. </p></li><li><p>Trump is launching a gold $499 cell phone. <em><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/687492/trump-mobile-phone-t1\">The Verge</a></em><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/687492/trump-mobile-phone-t1\"> broke down</a> everything you need to know about the phone <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/687574/trump-mobile-plan-bad-deal\">and Trump Mobile.</a> </p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3rF6!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf92835d-ad1e-4c4a-a455-6ef984857b97_840x506.webp\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3rF6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf92835d-ad1e-4c4a-a455-6ef984857b97_840x506.webp\" width=\"392\" height=\"236.13333333333333\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3rF6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf92835d-ad1e-4c4a-a455-6ef984857b97_840x506.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3rF6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf92835d-ad1e-4c4a-a455-6ef984857b97_840x506.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3rF6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf92835d-ad1e-4c4a-a455-6ef984857b97_840x506.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3rF6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf92835d-ad1e-4c4a-a455-6ef984857b97_840x506.webp 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a><figcaption>The Trump mobile phone will be an android</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><p>Twenty-somethings are getting into <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/lifestyle/relationships/20-somethings-grandma-hobbies-crochet-knitting-795bd985\">grandma hobbies</a> like crochet, knitting, and scrapbooking. </p></li><li><p>Scientists <a href=\"https://nypost.com/2025/06/15/science/scientists-detect-mysterious-radio-waves-coming-from-beneath-antarcticas-ice/\">detect mysterious radio waves</a> coming from beneath Antarctica’s ice.</p></li><li><p>Your boss is probably using AI more than you (<a href=\"https://archive.ph/EnUrO#selection-2633.0-2633.35\">managers use AI twice as much</a>).</p></li><li><p>LGBTQ representation in movies <a href=\"https://deadline.com/2025/06/lgbtq-representation-movies-3-year-low-glaad-1236431337/\">hits 3-Year low</a>. </p></li><li><p>Stanford research finds that \"therapist\" chatbots are encouraging users' <a href=\"https://futurism.com/stanford-therapist-chatbots-encouraging-delusions\">schizophrenic delusions</a> and suicidal thoughts.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://archive.ph/HYJH7#selection-1983.0-1987.55\">The rise of layoff culture</a>: Being laid off used to be a mark of shame. Not anymore.</p></li><li><p>The <a href=\"https://archive.ph/Fe8Q6#selection-2355.0-2366.0\">next wearable tech</a> could be a face 'tattoo' that measures mental stress.</p></li><li><p>Michelle Obama’s former nutrition adviser is pushing to <a href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/magazine/2025/06/14/michelle-obama-nutrition-adviser-maha-interview-00405018\">reinvent food policy</a> and fighting back against the anti-public health MAHA movement.</p></li><li><p>Saudi Arabia has <a href=\"https://cpj.org/2025/06/saudi-arabia-executes-journalist-turki-al-jasser-on-treason-terrorism-charges/\">executed prominent journalist</a> Turki al-Jasser, who was arrested over Twitter posts alleging corruption within the Saudi royal family.</p></li><li><p>Last week, <a href=\"https://x.com/BumpyNUX/status/1933443151274127791\">a user tweeted</a>, “You can just tweet “Zohran Mamdani” and immediately get 1,000 likes” and promptly got 20k likes. Now everyone is trying the trend <a href=\"https://x.com/svershbow/status/1934450959272321216\">and it’s working</a>, as support for the Mayoral candidate surges. Stan <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DZ1OblYm5YY\">Young Cardamom</a>!</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g8YZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ae4347a-4295-4be6-ae8c-d10119d98e6c_1179x1155.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g8YZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ae4347a-4295-4be6-ae8c-d10119d98e6c_1179x1155.jpeg\" width=\"392\" height=\"384.0203562340967\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g8YZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ae4347a-4295-4be6-ae8c-d10119d98e6c_1179x1155.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g8YZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4ae4347a-4295-4be6-ae8c-d